            <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1179047> .
    <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(81)90334-9> dct:title "A pre-pattern formation mechanism for animal coat markings" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.08.005> dct:title "Co-option of an ancestral Hox-regulated network underlies a recently evolved morphological novelty" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature03235> dct:title "Chance caught on the wing: cis-regulatory evolution and the origin of pigment patterns in Drosophila" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012> dct:title "The chemical basis of morphogenesis" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1179047> dct:title "Reaction-diffusion model as a framework for understanding biological pattern formation" .
